        "description": {
            "value": "<p>You force a creature to experience an instantaneous burst of severely multiplied gravity, wreaking havoc on their eyes and internal organs. The target takes 2d12 bludgeoning damage and 1d12 persistent bleed damage with a Fortitude save.</p><hr /><p><strong>Critical Success</strong> The target is unaffected.</p>\n<p><strong>Success</strong> The target takes half damage, is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Dazzled] for 1 round, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 1}.</p>\n<p><strong>Failure</strong> The target takes full damage, is dazzled for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 2}.</p>\n<p><strong>Critical Failure</strong> The target takes double damage, is dazzled for 1 minute, and is @UUID[Compendium.pf2e.conditionitems.Item.Stunned]{Stunned 3}.</p><hr /><p><strong>Heightened (+2)</strong> The bludgeoning damage increases by 1d12, and the persistent bleed damage increases by 1d12.</p>"
